{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 总纲MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与 MCP MOC\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> moc\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> meta/moc\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/MCP</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">总纲MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"工具调用与 MCP MOC\" dir=\"auto\">工具调用与 MCP MOC</h1>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>Agent 的工具调用（Tool Use / Function Calling）能力是其与外部世界交互的核心机制。MCP (Model Context Protocol) 是 Anthropic 推出的开放协议，标准化了 AI 模型与工具/数据源之间的连接。共 <strong>18 题</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"核心概念\" dir=\"auto\">核心概念</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Function Calling</strong> — LLM 输出结构化函数调用指令的能力</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Tool Use</strong> — Agent 选择、调用、处理工具结果的完整流程</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>MCP (Model Context Protocol)</strong> — 标准化的模型-上下文连接协议</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>A2A (Agent-to-Agent)</strong> — 多 Agent 间的通信协议</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"面试题集\" dir=\"auto\">面试题集</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"基础 (Fundamental)\" dir=\"auto\">基础 (Fundamental)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q01</td>\n<td>Function Calling 原理</td>\n<td>LLM 如何输出工具调用参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q02</td>\n<td>Tool Use 完整流程</td>\n<td>选择→调用→处理→总结</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q03</td>\n<td>工具定义 Schema</td>\n<td>OpenAPI/JSON Schema 规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q04</td>\n<td>常见工具类型</td>\n<td>搜索、计算、API、数据库等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"中级 (Intermediate)\" dir=\"auto\">中级 (Intermediate)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q05</td>\n<td>工具选择策略</td>\n<td>多工具场景下的路由与选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q06</td>\n<td>并行工具调用</td>\n<td>同时调用多个工具的实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q07</td>\n<td>错误处理与重试</td>\n<td>工具调用失败的处理机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q08</td>\n<td>MCP 协议核心概念</td>\n<td>Resources/Prompts/Tools 三大原语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q09</td>\n<td>MCP vs Function Calling</td>\n<td>两者区别与互补关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q10</td>\n<td>MCP Server 开发</td>\n<td>如何开发一个 MCP Server</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q11</td>\n<td>工具安全与权限</td>\n<td>工具调用的安全管控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"高级 (Advanced)\" dir=\"auto\">高级 (Advanced)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q12</td>\n<td>动态工具发现</td>\n<td>运行时工具注册与发现机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q13</td>\n<td>工具链编排</td>\n<td>多工具组合调用与依赖管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q14</td>\n<td>MCP 与 A2A 协议关系</td>\n<td>两个协议的协同与分工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q15</td>\n<td>工具调用性能优化</td>\n<td>延迟、并发、缓存策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q16</td>\n<td>自定义工具框架设计</td>\n<td>高扩展性工具系统架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q17</td>\n<td>工具调用可观测性</td>\n<td>调用链路追踪与监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q18</td>\n<td>生产级工具平台</td>\n<td>企业级工具治理平台设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"MCP 协议速览\" dir=\"auto\">MCP 协议速览</h2>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">MCP (Model Context Protocol)\n├── Resources — 只读数据资源\n│   ├── 文件系统\n│   ├── 数据库\n│   └── API 端点\n├── Prompts — 可复用提示模板\n│   ├── 任务模板\n│   └── 角色定义\n└── Tools — 可执行工具\n    ├── 查询类\n    ├── 操作类\n    └── 计算类\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"Function Calling vs MCP 对比\" dir=\"auto\">Function Calling vs MCP 对比</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Function Calling</th>\n<th>MCP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>定义方</td>\n<td>模型厂商</td>\n<td>开放协议 (Anthropic)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具注册</td>\n<td>客户端静态注册</td>\n<td>Server 动态暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输方式</td>\n<td>单次请求</td>\n<td>持久连接 (stdio/sse)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>简单工具调用</td>\n<td>复杂上下文管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>各厂商独立</td>\n<td>跨模型统一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">相关 MOC</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — Agent 整体基础，含 <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Q09-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EFunction-Calling/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Q09-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EFunction-Calling/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q09-工具调用与Function-Calling</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> — A2A 协议详解</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> — 工具系统的生产部署</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a> — 检索工具与知识库</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}